# Shared settings for every demo: a fixed window, a widely used color
# scheme (012 draws in the terminal's own palette by default, so the
# recordings show the scheme as it would look in your terminal), and a
# pace that reads well. Tapes run from demos/, so the binary is ../bin/012.
Set Shell "bash"
Set FontSize 16
Set Width 1000
Set Height 600
Set Padding 20
Set LineHeight 1.15
Set TypingSpeed 55ms
Set CursorBlink false
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
